{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/life

    A little life on a staff screen: what goes well in its own subject, under three small pennants, summed and without
    names (local\life). Nothing without it. Only the thing in a sentence is a link (a title), never the whole sentence.
    Each sentence carries all its own keys, which no page uses, so that a missing one is never looked up in the page
    around it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * life - lifelead, the words above, and lifeitems: lifebefore, lifelinked and lifeafter, and lifehref (empty for
      no link, and then the whole sentence is in lifebefore).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "life": {
            "lifelead": "Still going out",
            "lifeitems": [
                {"lifebefore": "87 % of what came back this school year came back on time.", "lifelinked": "",
                    "lifeafter": "", "lifehref": ""},
                {"lifebefore": "«", "lifelinked": "The lighthouse",
                    "lifeafter": "», from 1914, has gone out 3 times this school year.",
                    "lifehref": "https://example.org/local/oksigeniaayvurenda/record.php?id=1"}
            ]
        }
    }
}}
{{#life}}
<section class="ayv-life" aria-label="{{lifelead}}">
    <p class="ayv-life-lead"><span class="ayv-desk-moment-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{lifelead}}</p>
    <ul class="ayv-life-items">
        {{#lifeitems}}<li>{{lifebefore}}{{#lifehref}}<a href="{{lifehref}}">{{lifelinked}}</a>{{/lifehref}}{{lifeafter}}</li>{{/lifeitems}}
    </ul>
</section>
{{/life}}
